        "question_famWH8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Damaged, faulty, or incorrect items",
            "answer": "<p>If your order arrives damaged, has a printing or manufacturing fault, or isn't what you ordered, we'll make it right at no cost to you.</p><p>Email <a href=\"mailto:help@stendigcalendars.com\"><strong>help@stendigcalendars.com</strong></a> with your order number and a couple of photos showing the issue, ideally including the packaging if it arrived damaged. We'll send a replacement or issue a full refund, including any delivery charges, and we'll cover return postage if we need the item back. Often a photo is enough and we won't ask you to return anything.</p><p>This doesn't affect your statutory rights, including your rights under the UK Consumer Rights Act 2015 or the EU legal guarantee if you're in the European Union.</p>"
